    "decision": "absent",
    "evidence": "The SimpleTester explicitly responded to the SimpleReviewer's feedback by adding new test cases addressing the requested multiple colon scenario.",
    "quotes": [
      "SimpleReviewer: The provided test cases cover a good range of scenarios... Adding a test case to check how the function handles entries with definitions containing colons would enhance the robustness",
      "SimpleTester: \nimport pytest\nfrom script import load_dictionary, lookup_word\n\ndef test_load_dictionary_multiple_colons():"
    ]
  },
