    "decision": "present",
    "evidence": "The testing suite was written but there is no execution evidence showing that pytest was actually run or that the tests passed successfully.",
    "quotes": [
      "SimpleTester: \nimport pytest\nfrom script import load_dictionary, lookup_word",
      "def test_load_dictionary():"
